            {
                "entry_id": "09793374-a926-3b25-9020-769a92b0ec6b",
                "word": "exquisément",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "68b83fcc-36a4-426d-9efb-09f495b5e0cf",
                        "entry_id": "09793374-a926-3b25-9020-769a92b0ec6b",
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "form": "exquisement"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35eb56b4-527f-334d-a7e4-18d3c7e1a3f6",
                        "entry_id": "09793374-a926-3b25-9020-769a92b0ec6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière exquise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ad0c1f0-5bc6-4d91-a326-d1a290a4819f",
                                "sense_id": "35eb56b4-527f-334d-a7e4-18d3c7e1a3f6",
                                "text": "L’amour, ce n’est pas seulement cette… cette finalité passionnée qui vous rattache à Renaud, ce n’est pas cette dépendance volontaire où vous vivez, ce n’est pas cette tendresse déjà grave que Renaud vous prodigue et qui s’épure lentement, exquisément — ce sont vos propres paroles ! proteste-t-elle à cause de mon geste…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8137634-2643-4dde-955c-bd6b560f74c5",
                                "sense_id": "35eb56b4-527f-334d-a7e4-18d3c7e1a3f6",
                                "text": "Certes elle a la profonde intelligence des arts. Mais ce n’est peut-être pas là qu’elle est le plus admirable ; et telle petite action ingénieusement, exquisément bonne, qu’elle a accomplie pour moi, telle géniale attention, tel geste familièrement sublime, révèlent une compréhension plus profonde de l’existence que tous les traités de philosophie. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea4184a9-ec88-4cb0-9d66-7e24e9abda1a",
                                "sense_id": "35eb56b4-527f-334d-a7e4-18d3c7e1a3f6",
                                "text": "22 octobre 44 – « Hallo ? Leutnant (prononcer exquisément Loutènant) Heller speaking."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dcbc66d0-2e22-40d6-a5a6-cc6d478f10d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "09793374-a926-3b25-9020-769a92b0ec6b",
                        "source_sense_id": "35eb56b4-527f-334d-a7e4-18d3c7e1a3f6",
                        "target_lang_word": "exquisitely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "exquisitely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab0bcc09-c620-3293-94be-0e6dbb0774ab",
                                        "entry_id": "097c46ab-f217-3c2d-812b-1093c94bf571",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an exquisite manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59adec98-be1b-4aae-8e9a-1d2afdb91052",
                                                "sense_id": "ab0bcc09-c620-3293-94be-0e6dbb0774ab",
                                                "text": "Over the fish-dish — something sole-like, exquisitely seethed in a strange sauce, garnished with roots and fruits of the country — Tommy became sentimental."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a96cd4f-d925-32d8-a4a1-90fe9c06d64c",
                                        "entry_id": "097c46ab-f217-3c2d-812b-1093c94bf571",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exceedingly; in the highest degree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67857444-977b-439a-8503-c0b135b7a046",
                                                "sense_id": "6a96cd4f-d925-32d8-a4a1-90fe9c06d64c",
                                                "text": "There was something exquisitely painful in the memories that crowded upon his mind: a thousand of Constance's daily acts of affection rose before him: neyer till this moment had he felt them unrequited; but now they were remembered like a reproach."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "208af548-4a34-46ad-b7a3-bae4bb70fb5a",
                                                "sense_id": "6a96cd4f-d925-32d8-a4a1-90fe9c06d64c",
                                                "text": "They danced on silently, softly. Their feet played tricks to the beat of the tireless measure, that exquisitely asinine blare which is England's punishment for having lost America."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
